.Dd September 19, 2026
.Dt BUSYBOX-E2FSPROGS 8
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm busybox-e2fsprogs ,
.Nm chattr ,
.Nm fsck ,
.Nm lsattr
.Nd BusyBox file system attribute and check tools
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm chattr
.Op Fl R
.Op Fl v Ar VERSION
.Op Fl p Ar PROJID
.Op Ar -+=AacDdijsStTu
.Ar FILE ...
.Nm fsck
.Op Fl ANPRTV
.Op Fl t Ar FSTYPE
.Op Ar FS_OPTS
.Op Ar BLOCKDEV
.Ar ...
.Nm lsattr
.Op Fl Radlpv
.Op Ar FILE
.Ar ...
.Sh DESCRIPTION
These are the e2fsprogs applets of BusyBox 1.36.1 as built for Rach2.
.Bl -tag -width chattr
.It Nm chattr
Change ext2 file attributes.
Rach2 does not implement the ext2 attribute, generation, and project
number ioctl requests this applet uses.
.It Nm fsck
Check and repair file systems by running
.Pa fsck.TYPE
for the selected file system type.
The recovery system's ext2 checker is the separate e2fsprogs program
.Xr e2fsck 8 .
.It Nm lsattr
List ext2 file attributes.
Rach2 does not implement the ext2 attribute ioctl requests this applet uses.
.El
.Sh OPTIONS
.Ss chattr
.Bl -tag -width "-v NUM"
.It Fl R
Recurse into directories.
.It Fl v Ar NUM
Set the version or generation number.
.It Fl p Ar NUM
Set the project number.
.El
.Ss fsck
.Bl -tag -width "-A"
.It Fl A
Read
.Pa /etc/fstab
and check all file systems.
.It Fl N
Show what would be done without executing checkers.
.It Fl P
With
.Fl A ,
do not check the root file system separately before the others.
.It Fl R
With
.Fl A ,
skip the root file system.
.It Fl T
Suppress the startup title.
.It Fl V
Produce verbose output.
.El
.Ss lsattr
.Bl -tag -width "-R"
.It Fl R
Recurse into directories.
.It Fl a
Include names beginning with a period.
.It Fl d
List directory names instead of their contents.
.El
.Sh FILES
.Bl -tag -width /etc/fstab
.It Pa /etc/fstab
File systems to check with
.Nm fsck Fl A .
.El
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr e2fsck 8
.Sh HISTORY
